<title>UK: UK CLEARS SCOTTISH MEDIA'S BUY OF GRAMPIAN.</title>
<headline>UK CLEARS SCOTTISH MEDIA'S BUY OF GRAMPIAN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Trade and Industry on Tuesday cleared Scottish Media Group Plc's 105 million stg acquisition of Grampian Television Plc.</p>
<p>The DTI said it would not refer the deal to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission.</p>
<p>The regulator also said it cleared United Drug Plc's acquisition of Gehe AG's Daniels Pharmaceutical in Belfast. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
